{"id":"n72138-1-8","stage":1,"title":"출구 · 出口","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72138-1-8-1","ko":"지금 지하철역에 내렸는데 어디 계십니까?","zh":"我现在在地铁站下了，您在哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"지하철역에","meaning":"地铁站","explanation":"지하철역：地铁站；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지하철역","audio":"/audio/64860555fc86a9fbcb01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77822","senseId":"1","lemma":"지하철역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지하철역에","audio":"/audio/c21ad389c449ed36f264.mp3"}},{"text":"내렸는데","meaning":"下车（在地铁站下车）","explanation":"내리다：下车（在地铁站下车）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"4","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내렸는데","audio":"/audio/2a6bf985cc6170c8adb2.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"계십니까?","meaning":"(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方。","explanation":"계시다：(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17749","senseId":"2","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계십니까","audio":"/audio/bb3fb302a3a371161c50.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","defini